{"4504630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "人性游戏", "steam_appid": 4504630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“The Human Game” </i> is a battle of humanity waged with life as the stake. Jingchuan and An’nan, underground debt slaves, risk their lives on a hundred‑meter high steel bridge to break free. After surviving, they fall into a greater conspiracy: the mysterious tycoon Zhou Muyun experiments on human nature and controls everything with the Messiah System.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From deadly crises and psychological struggles to street chases and uncovering the truth of their father’s lab, they face the ultimate choice between survival and loyalty. When facing the fatal danger of being sealed in cement, they defy cold data control with a bond stronger than instinct, proving that the light of humanity can never be defined by algorithms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players conduct investigations to obtain different items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player decisions shape the direction of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing when to buy items affects the ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reaction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick, correct responses determine story progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Paths</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different branches unlock unique items and story routes.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“The Human Game” </i> is a battle of humanity waged with life as the stake. Jingchuan and An’nan, underground debt slaves, risk their lives on a hundred‑meter high steel bridge to break free. After surviving, they fall into a greater conspiracy: the mysterious tycoon Zhou Muyun experiments on human nature and controls everything with the Messiah System.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From deadly crises and psychological struggles to street chases and uncovering the truth of their father’s lab, they face the ultimate choice between survival and loyalty. When facing the fatal danger of being sealed in cement, they defy cold data control with a bond stronger than instinct, proving that the light of humanity can never be defined by algorithms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players conduct investigations to obtain different items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player decisions shape the direction of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing when to buy items affects the ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reaction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick, correct responses determine story progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Paths</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different branches unlock unique items and story routes.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "“The Human Game” is an immersive interactive fiction game. You play as Jingchuan, a debt slave who risks his life on a high‑altitude bridge to break free. Surviving to uncover a conspiracy. Face the ultimate choice between survival and morality, and advance the story via exploration and choices.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, English<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504630/cf1f